    "Speaker": "竹本・高師直 (Narrator & Kō no Moronō)",
    "Japanese_Ruby": "<ruby>俄<rt>にわか</rt></ruby>に<ruby>詞改<rt>ことばあらため</rt></ruby>て。「<ruby>是<rt>これ</rt></ruby>は／＼／＼<ruby>悼入<rt>いたみいっ</rt></ruby>たる<ruby>仕合<rt>しあわせ</rt></ruby>。<ruby>伴内<rt>ばんない</rt></ruby>こりやどふした<ruby>物<rt>もの</rt></ruby>。ハテ<ruby>扨々<rt>さてさて</rt></ruby>。ハアお<ruby>辭宜申<rt>じぎもう</rt></ruby>さばお<ruby>志背<rt>こころざしそむ</rt></ruby>くといひ。<ruby>第一<rt>だいいち</rt></ruby>は<ruby>大<rt>おお</rt></ruby>きなぶ<ruby>禮<rt>れい</rt></ruby>。ヱヽ<ruby>式作法<rt>しきさほう</rt></ruby>を<ruby>教<rt>おしゆ</rt></ruby>るも。こんな<ruby>折<rt>おり</rt></ruby>にはとんとこまる。ナニものじやは。」",
    "Japanese_Plain": "俄に詞改て。「是は／＼／＼悼入たる仕合。伴内こりやどふした物。ハテ扨々。ハアお辭宜申さばお志背くといひ。第一は大きなぶ禮。ヱヽ式作法を教るも。こんな折にはとんとこまる。ナニものじやは。」",
    "English": "Suddenly changing his tune, Moronō gushes: 'Well, well, well! I am quite overwhelmed! What are we to do, Bannai? Dear me! If I refuse, I offend their kind generosity—and worse, commit a grave breach of courtesy! Ah, even a teacher of etiquette gets caught in a bind on occasions like this! What a predicament!'",
    "Notes": "On stage, Moronō steps out of his palanquin (or drops his menacing posture) and instantly turns silky and unctuous.",
